title: Unconstrained Delegation TGT Capture
id: 544b740b-6854-445c-899e-d9a6a64c1b6e
status: experimental
description: Detects setting the TRUSTED_FOR_DELEGATION flag on an account (event 4738/5136 with userAccountControl change), which enables unconstrained delegation and lets the host capture forwarded TGTs of any connecting user.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1558/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID:
      - 4738
      - 5136
    AttributeValue|contains: 'TRUSTED_FOR_DELEGATION'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
  - ObjectName
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate delegation configuration
level: high
tags:
  - attack.credential_access
  - attack.t1558
